OL,3,AMichelle O'Neill says DUP has blocked
OL,4,Aher from PM meeting in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill has said Deputy First
OL,8,FMinister Emma Little-Pengelly has
OL,9,F"blocked" them from attending an
OL,10,Feconomic summit involving Prime
OL,11,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,13,FThe Sinn Fein vice-president and
OL,14,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,15,Fminister were both invited to attend
OL,16,Fthe National Economic Council in
OL,17,FGlasgow on Friday alongside other
OL,18,Fdevolved leaders.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
