OL,3,AMichelle O'Neill says DUP has blocked
OL,4,Aher from PM meeting in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move follows unionist anger over
OL,7,FSinn Fein's involvement in protests
OL,8,Fwhich prevented a contentious Orange
OL,9,FOrder march in Portadown from passing
OL,10,Falong the mainly nationalist Garvaghy
OL,11,FRoad.
OL,13,FO'Neill described the move as "reckless
OL,14,Fand irresponsible" and meant people in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland "will not be
OL,16,Frepresented".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
